{"id":"chatcmpl-945cd345-3f9a-4264-ae46-86c99181412d","object":"chat.completion","created":1795245116,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a cross-validation strategy for medical image interpretation where ambiguous visual findings are resolved by querying multiple independent expert models. The pattern emphasizes using specialized domain tools first, then corroborating with a second model before committing to an answer. It also shows how to handle lateral-view anatomy questions where laterality is non-obvious.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a visual finding's laterality or identity is ambiguous, query a domain-specific expert tool first, then cross-validate with an independent general-purpose model before answering.\",\n    \"For imaging tasks, explicitly state the view/orientation (e.g., lateral, labeled side) in the query to anchor the model's anatomical reasoning.\",\n    \"Use consensus between two independent sources as the decision criterion when the question is binary and the visual evidence is subtle.\",\n    \"Decompose the question into a descriptive sub-query (describe relative positions) and a direct sub-query (which is higher) to triangulate the answer.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging QA\": \"Route to a specialized imaging expert first; include view/orientation metadata in the prompt; confirm with a second independent model before finalizing.\",\n    \"Binary visual classification\": \"Ask both a descriptive and a direct question; require agreement across two sources to reduce single-model error.\",\n    \"Ambiguous laterality tasks\": \"Anchor queries with explicit orientation labels and ask models to reason about standard anatomical conventions.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the image view/orientation is stated in every tool query.\",\n    \"Verify at least two independent sources agree before selecting the final option.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":457,"total_tokens":803,"completion_tokens":346,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":457},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":346}}}